{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_21\">Problem 21</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 21\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/8/ae8d44fdb2e6e6df21b04e89417b325e5a988c59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt {x} + 2x^{ - \\frac {1}{2}} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"23\" /> can be found by solving: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2fa644e0c8f0544c9c88254f0d1788e72fbfcfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 16x^2-92x+1 = 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 4x^2-25x+4 = 0\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4x^2-17x+4 = 0\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2x^2-21x+2 = 0\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4x^2-25x-4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"605\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Make the substitution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804e013f729cc615b37ccf6ea259ff997eec7579.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/a/d9a6a38d980e4c155d79e23374a3b9ed13d92d1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2t+\\frac{2}{t}=5\\implies 2t^2-5t+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"259\" height=\"37\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f59fbd173345bd28668a30bb37931a56614b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-5\\sqrt{x}+2=0\\implies 2x+2=5\\sqrt{x}\\implies (2x+2)^2=25x\\implies 4x^2+8x+4=25x\\implies 4x^2-17x+4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"868\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b